WEBVTT

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.100
Sa-to-mi!

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.230
Allowance, please.

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.390
How much?

00:00:13.390 --> 00:00:14.810
Wow, you're giving him one?

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.860
Umm... A lot?

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:18.690
Very well.

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:19.990
And you're giving it to him!

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.230
Now about this!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.000
A REPEAT OF OTSUKA VILLAGE?!
A New Disease? Reanimated Corpses!
Five supposedly dead men came back to life one by one.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.090
If you know anything about
this, please tell me.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.570
Five supposedly
dead men came back
to life one by one.

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:27.000
A REPEAT OF OTSUKA VILLAGE?!

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.880
I do not know all of the details myself.

00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:35.880
Five villagers stepped foot on a mountain
that had been placed off limits.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.400
A week after their return, the entire party
died of a mysterious illness.

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:43.550
That region is somewhat unique.

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.680
The area rarely sees rain,

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:49.510
but there is a mountain called
"Stashed Mountain" just behind the village.

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:52.000
As the name implies,
that is the only area

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.250
blessed with a plentiful "stash" of rain.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:58.530
"Stash"?

00:00:59.110 --> 00:01:01.910
A "stash" refers to "secret savings".

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:05.290
It implies that the rain
only benefits a select few.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:10.400
In other words, the rain that only quenches
those living in a specific area...

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:12.800
...is called "stashed rain".

00:01:13.270 --> 00:01:14.800
Really?

00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:18.710
That mountain rain is where our
underground water comes from.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:22.340
It was just barely enough
to keep our crops alive.

00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:25.470
But lately that water
has been running dry...

00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:27.810
Goodness!

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:28.840
It's hot!

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:30.710
I take it you are the musicians.

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:33.820
I humbly thank you for
inviting our troupe.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:38.850
Honestly, I was afraid you may not come
after that dreadful incident.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:41.830
And how could we hold a festival
without a few beautiful flowers?

00:01:42.190 --> 00:01:44.330
Come along! Follow me
to the mayor's house.

00:01:48.660 --> 00:01:49.520
Asakeno?

00:03:26.670 --> 00:03:31.520
Stashed

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:28.610
Supposedly the five men entered

00:03:28.610 --> 00:03:31.520
the mountain in search
of a new water source.

00:03:32.050 --> 00:03:33.690
Why is that area off limits?

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.630
A monkey spirit has resided
on that mountain since ancient times.

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:40.770
The urban legend claims that any
who go there never come back.

00:03:41.530 --> 00:03:43.380
Yet all five of them came back.

00:03:44.770 --> 00:03:46.410
They wandered around the mountain

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.480
and just as they were about
to die of starvation,

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.660
a beautiful woman supposedly
appeared before them.

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:56.450
The woman showed the
five men the path home

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:59.150
and shared some of her water with them.

00:04:00.620 --> 00:04:04.170
They fell ill with the same illness that struck
Otsuka Village five years ago...

00:04:05.580 --> 00:04:07.950
A woman... gave them water...

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.440
Mr. Satomi, have you seen Shino?

00:04:14.050 --> 00:04:17.440
It is time for lunch, but I can't
seem to find him anywhere.

00:04:19.180 --> 00:04:21.980
I expected him to go, but not alone...

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:22.850
He left?

00:04:22.850 --> 00:04:25.450
Sosuke, it would be wise for you to run
after Shino immediately.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:27.560
What are you talking about?

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:38.980
This mountain is seriously
the only place gettin' any rain...

00:04:40.740 --> 00:04:41.510
Shino!

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:46.830
The gems are glowing....

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:50.970
Both mine and Sosuke's...

00:04:49.470 --> 00:04:51.470
DEVOTION
DUTY

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.850
Have they ever done this before?

00:04:55.670 --> 00:04:56.410
Look out!

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:08.780
Were you dreaming of that man again?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:11.290
Are you all right?

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:13.750
Yeah...

00:05:21.540 --> 00:05:25.290
The man who took everything from me...

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:30.140
A woman appeared in Otsuka Village
five years ago as well.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:33.820
The only reason Shino, Hamaji
and I didn't grow ill...

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:36.480
...was because of
Shino's failing health.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.650
We had been staying with him in the
neighboring village's clinic, after which...

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:45.270
It's no use. My memories are too hazy.

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:47.150
Sosuke!

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.940
Kobungo, what brought you here?

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:52.920
I was seein' a customer off.

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:56.160
You wouldn't be searchin'
for Shino, would ya?

00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:57.350
Did you see him?

00:05:57.670 --> 00:06:00.490
Yeah. I saw him jump on
a train headed westward.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:02.420
I was too late...

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:05.170
So he slipped away without tellin' ya?

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:06.620
Yes.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.330
Do you know where he's headed?

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.180
Yes, I will go after
him as soon as I can.

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:13.510
You're going after Shino?

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:17.240
Bro, don't pop out of nowhere!

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:22.300
The next westward-bound
train departs in two hours.

00:06:22.300 --> 00:06:24.970
And yer totally bent on goin'.

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.700
Later! I'm gonna hit the
kitchen and pack some grub.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:29.060
Excuse me, but...

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:31.840
If he left you behind, then he must

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:34.530
have gone somewhere untoward.

00:06:34.530 --> 00:06:37.710
When ya walk around with two demons,
it's like having bodyguards.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:42.510
That would be most reassuring.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:46.790
The mountain I intend to visit
is said to harbor a monkey spirit.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:49.220
Eh? You're gettin' mixed
up with more monsters?

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:57.750
Murasame...?

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:01.730
The gems...!

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:04.230
DEVOTION

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.430
Where'd Sosuke's gem go?

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:14.420
Crap! It's gone.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:33.140
Have you seen a gem just like this?

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.210
It's super important...

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:42.490
I'm holding onto it for a friend.

00:07:43.260 --> 00:07:45.770
It'd be really bad if I lost it...

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:08.800
Wh-what is this? A stone?!

00:08:10.000 --> 00:08:11.300
This isn't it!

00:08:11.680 --> 00:08:14.030
It's not like this at all! It's a small-

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:17.360
My bad!

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.640
There is no way you could find somethin'

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.090
that puny when you're so huge.

00:08:21.090 --> 00:08:22.710
I'll look for it myself.

00:08:23.930 --> 00:08:26.900
Yep! This is shiny just like my ball.

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:29.400
Thank you!

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:40.410
Doc, will it spread and
infect the other villagers?

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:44.380
So far the only ones to have shown
any symptoms are the five deceased.

00:08:44.950 --> 00:08:46.910
What 'bout the festival tomorrow?

00:08:47.030 --> 00:08:52.420
You can still hold the festival,
but be sure to watch what you drink.

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:56.540
That's a lot to ask for when
we're supposed to be partying...

00:08:56.540 --> 00:09:00.050
Didn't we invite some women
musicians to spice things up?

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:02.810
Yep! The troupe was
filled with hot babes!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.760
Dang, I can't wait to see them!

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.020
You gents certainly had your eyes
glued on them, didn't you?

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:07.020
They'll make for some sweet eye candy!

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:11.680
Oh, I'm sorry! You're
plenty pretty, Doc!

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:14.350
You're just a tad past your prime.

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:16.400
We'll find a groom for ya!

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.910
That won't be necessary! Now beat it.

00:09:20.270 --> 00:09:22.320
Hey, remember how some villagers

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:24.160
visited the mountain a while ago?

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:29.990
Aside from those villagers, did you see

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:31.170
a woman around that same time?

00:09:33.990 --> 00:09:37.480
I'm... not sure what
her face looked like,

00:09:37.480 --> 00:09:38.900
but she had long hair.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:42.630
I've seen her countless
times in my dreams,

00:09:44.030 --> 00:09:47.090
but I can never seem to remember that woman's face.

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:55.070
I see. I figured you wouldn't know.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:57.420
What should I do...?

00:09:57.980 --> 00:10:00.230
After coming all of the way
here, I'm still empty-handed.

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:02.230
And I lost Sosuke's gem.

00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:04.080
I'm such a moron.

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:06.900
I would appreciate it if you

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.580
applied what you've learned
from this henceforth...

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:13.290
That might be too much
for your tiny head.

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:15.580
Don't call it "tiny"!

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.830
Oh, he looks just fine to me.

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:20.590
I can't believe you went this deep
into the mountain by yourself.

00:10:20.880 --> 00:10:23.100
No, I wasn't alone! He was-

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:27.610
Were you with someone?

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:29.850
No...

00:10:30.970 --> 00:10:33.230
Sosuke, your gem...

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.340
My gem?

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:37.040
I dropped it when I fell...

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:41.300
I've been looking for it, but
I can't find it anywhere...

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:47.030
You've searched hard
enough. Let's go back.

00:10:47.030 --> 00:10:47.870
Not happening!

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:52.530
It's a part of you, so we've
gotta take good care of it.

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:53.880
I won't stop until I find it!

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:59.630
Sooner or later the gem will
come back to me if it so desires.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:00.880
But-!

00:11:04.420 --> 00:11:07.460
It's not as if it will
rot. I'll be fine.

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:10.660
So, I'm sorry...!

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.810
He left...

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:20.420
Such is the nature of children.

00:11:20.890 --> 00:11:23.900
They are whimsical and cruel...

00:11:27.530 --> 00:11:29.700
Let's find an inn and stay the night.

00:11:31.590 --> 00:11:32.820
Hey, excuse me!

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:36.630
See, this here kid got
lost on the mountain.

00:11:36.860 --> 00:11:38.630
We just got back down after
finally finding the lad.

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:41.430
Are there any inns around
this neck of the woods?

00:11:46.920 --> 00:11:48.020
What gives?

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:51.220
Why'd they do that?

00:11:53.260 --> 00:11:56.020
They were perfectly healthy when they
descended from the mountain.

00:11:56.600 --> 00:11:58.590
Shortly thereafter, they were struck by

00:11:58.590 --> 00:12:00.150
high fevers and slowly began to decay.

00:12:00.680 --> 00:12:04.030
Even after their flesh melted away
to expose the bones underneath...

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:06.470
...the bodies continued to move.

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:09.650
It was as if they were the walking dead.

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:12.920
It was just like five years ago...

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:15.910
Akane baby!

00:12:16.700 --> 00:12:19.420
I came over incognito! Or close enough.

00:12:20.290 --> 00:12:21.540
What brought you here?

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:25.380
Gosh, you're so cold!
I'm a medical examiner, remember?

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.140
When I heard that you're here,

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.450
I decided to accept the
post in this hick town!

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:31.430
What did you need?

00:12:32.550 --> 00:12:35.940
We've got newcomers; living samples.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:43.810
There is absolutely nothing
to do in this town, is there?

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:44.450
Yeah!
There is absolutely nothing to do in this town, is there?

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:46.190
"Don't go outside."

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:48.320
"Only eat and drink what we give you."

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.610
Talk about a pain!

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:53.070
I am ready to move on to the next town.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:53.450
You said it!

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:54.960
Seriously!
You said it!

00:12:53.850 --> 00:12:57.490
Asakeno, a government official
from the Imperial Capital is here.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:00.950
I couldn't care less.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:03.440
It's not as if we'll get any
money out of him, right?

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:06.540
Hey, did you hear?

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:08.530
Supposedly they caught the outsiders

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:10.280
who went up into the mountain.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:12.850
I heard about that! They're
a group of young men.

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:15.600
Young men?! Did you
catch a glimpse of them?

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.770
But I didn't do anything!

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:25.940
Kobungo, you didn't do anything wrong.

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:28.640
This rascal here is the one at fault.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:29.620
Mew...

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.540
I heard that you entered
Stashed Mountain.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:34.810
You must not value your lives.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.500
Are the two of you
members of the Church?

00:13:38.920 --> 00:13:39.610
Yes.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:42.860
I'm Saiki.

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:46.210
I serve not only as the sister here,
but also as the doctor.

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:49.190
There is a possibility that
you have contracted that illness.

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:51.670
Until I know one way or the
other, I cannot let you go.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:52.390
Say what?!

00:13:53.090 --> 00:13:55.370
For starters, I will
conduct some blood tests.

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:59.650
Akane baby, how are they? Any hot studs?

00:14:00.550 --> 00:14:01.400
You're...!

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:06.670
It is a pleasure to see
you again, Lt. Inukai!

00:14:07.120 --> 00:14:09.280
I have not seen you since
the northern battlefront!

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:10.980
And you are?

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:13.940
Sir! At that time, I was
stationed in the rear

00:14:13.940 --> 00:14:16.150
as a medical officer in training!

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:18.570
Gah! You're Joji Sakuraba!

00:14:18.570 --> 00:14:20.970
Oh, my gosh! If it isn't Kobungo.

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:23.050
You actually remembered me, Dear?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.870
Don't just go, "Oh"!

00:14:25.870 --> 00:14:28.070
Everyone was so terrified
of him that they couldn't

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:29.640
fall back to the rear when they got hurt!

00:14:29.640 --> 00:14:32.130
Terrorists in the front,
him in the back!

00:14:32.130 --> 00:14:34.810
He earned the nickname "Love
Terrorist in the Rear"!

00:14:34.950 --> 00:14:37.310
Golly, that takes me back!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:38.850
What are they talking about?

00:14:39.220 --> 00:14:40.710
Something scary.

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:45.070
Could you hurry and get
to work, M.E. Sakuraba?

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:46.900
Thanks for the reminder.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.250
Knock it off! Stay back!

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:02.370
There's nothin' wrong with me!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:03.410
Yeah, yeah. Now let me
see your army-warmy.

00:15:03.410 --> 00:15:04.490
No! Stay away from me!
Yeah, yeah. Now let me see your army-warmy.

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:04.960
Relax. It will only hurt for a second.

00:15:04.960 --> 00:15:06.830
You're up next, Shrimp.
Relax. It will only hurt for a second.

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:07.720
Don't call me a shrimp!

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:10.470
Shino, keep your thoughts to yourself.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:11.630
But she called me a...

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:13.000
Let me see your arm already.

00:15:14.570 --> 00:15:17.630
That's kinda cold. What'd you put on it?

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:18.800
You'll be fine. It isn't
going to hurt you.

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:20.230
I found him...
You'll be fine. It isn't going to hurt you.

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.630
That face... That voice...

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:26.600
Two years ago, that
man took everything...

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:31.140
That man has taken my life...

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:34.690
...once already!

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:54.540
I heard that Harada's well
finally dried up on him.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:58.510
Yeah. Really, this probably
isn't the time for a festival.

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:08.220
I'm shocked.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:10.740
And here you don't bat
an eye over monsters.

00:16:11.310 --> 00:16:13.150
Believe it or not, he
hates the sight of filth.

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:15.480
I can't believe I spent
the night in this dump!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:18.330
Your test results came back clear.

00:16:18.750 --> 00:16:19.830
You may come out.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.990
Then get moving! Hurry!

00:16:21.990 --> 00:16:22.830
Okay, okay.

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.540
However, there is still
some room for concern.

00:16:26.330 --> 00:16:29.450
I'll lend you a room in the
church, so keep a low profile.

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:31.750
Don't wander around the village.

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:32.840
What the hell?!

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:35.090
You're just upgrading our prison cell!

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:39.730
Asakeno!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:41.870
What is the matter?

00:16:41.870 --> 00:16:43.870
It is unusual for you to don a mask.

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:49.610
I see...

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:52.070
We could hardly let the audience

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.240
behold such a chilling countenance.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:56.830
I found him...

00:16:57.430 --> 00:16:58.400
Found whom?

00:17:02.360 --> 00:17:05.860
Yikes! I bet the place is
covered in tons of dust.

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:08.390
Suck it up and deal with it
until the festival is over.

00:17:08.830 --> 00:17:10.130
How long is the festival?

00:17:10.660 --> 00:17:11.990
Three days, starting today.

00:17:17.670 --> 00:17:19.220
Shino!

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:23.890
I was wondering why I
didn't see you last night.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:27.400
You weren't out all night searching
for that gem, were you?

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:28.520
Yep, sure-

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:34.160
Shino, it is unwise
to have Murasame spend

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:36.210
long periods of time away from you.

00:17:37.790 --> 00:17:41.530
It is as vital to your
existence as your own heart.

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:43.630
It will have an adverse effect

00:17:43.630 --> 00:17:45.590
on your body
if you're apart for too long.

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:48.030
And if anything were to happen
to Murasame, your life-

00:17:48.030 --> 00:17:49.170
I know, sheesh!

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:50.830
Do you really, Shino?

00:17:50.830 --> 00:17:51.950
Stop pestering me!

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:53.170
Shino, where are you going?!

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:55.700
I won't hit the village!
Be back in a bit!

00:18:01.590 --> 00:18:05.010
Murasame, Sosuke's being a pain.
Stay inside of me for a while.

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:05.560
Roger.

00:18:09.030 --> 00:18:09.560
You there!

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:13.070
Are you one of the children
living in this church?

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:16.550
Nope, I'm just dropping
by. I'm an outsider here.

00:18:17.270 --> 00:18:20.320
Oh! So you're with the group
that entered the mountain yesterday.

00:18:20.550 --> 00:18:22.690
If you heard about that,
didn't they warn you?

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:24.080
You're supposed to stay away from us.

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:28.990
I'm nothing but an outsider myself.
Their rules mean nothing to me.

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:32.200
Will you be staying here for a while?

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:34.090
Yeah, I guess.

00:18:34.390 --> 00:18:36.740
We're stayin' at the church
until the festival's over.

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:40.130
I see... So you're
staying at the church.

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:44.420
Hey, Shino! Where are you?

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:44.850
Kobungo?

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:47.350
Oh, there you are!

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:49.450
I will see you around, Shino.

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.070
Who was that super hot chick?
Who was she? Are ya friends?

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:00.110
I don't know her!

00:19:05.280 --> 00:19:07.280
You're just wasting your time.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:12.500
I've never held service in here.
It's only ever used as a clinic.

00:19:12.950 --> 00:19:15.470
Even so, I can't believe
all of this dust!

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:19.820
It doesn't matter. There
is no god here to worship.

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.850
And even if there were,
I don't need any gods

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:24.510
who get worked up over a bit of dust.

00:19:25.460 --> 00:19:27.800
Doctor, have you always
worked out of this church?

00:19:28.130 --> 00:19:30.320
No, I came three years ago.

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:33.270
My belated grandmother
lived in this village.

00:19:33.850 --> 00:19:36.720
I chose this location since
I often came to visit when I was a child.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.290
You must be busy.

00:19:40.140 --> 00:19:44.530
By the way, why did that
child enter Stashed Mountain?

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:47.250
Sorry about that. He is
bursting with curiosity.

00:19:47.780 --> 00:19:49.480
I will be sure to give
him a sound scolding.

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:52.530
That child is probably the only reason

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:54.670
why your party made it back alive.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:20:01.300
The man-eating monkey spirit allegedly
has a soft spot for children.

00:20:02.710 --> 00:20:04.180
My, how adorable!

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:07.130
That little doll must have
left this by mistake.

00:20:09.010 --> 00:20:10.720
Dear me, what could this be?

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.330
Oh, my goodness! Isn't this...?

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.360
What is all this?

00:20:20.800 --> 00:20:22.480
Did you guys make this?

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:25.650
His family runs an inn.

00:20:26.020 --> 00:20:27.200
He picked up how to cook after

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.200
sneaking in and out of the
kitchen since he was a child.

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.450
Shino, it's dinnertime!

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:34.460
Go fetch Sosuke and apologize
to him while you're at it.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:36.210
Not happening.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.460
You don't have much time
before he blows a gasket.

00:20:40.290 --> 00:20:42.290
You'd better apologize now
while he's still smiling.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:45.700
He's the type that holds a grudge
if you manage to piss him off.

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:56.760
You do not believe in any
gods and yet you still pray?

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:04.510
At the very least, I have a god.

00:21:04.810 --> 00:21:08.160
He is a truly small spitfire of a god.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:11.360
How could that possibly be of any value?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:14.500
No matter how strongly you believe in him,
he won't save you.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:16.660
It can't be helped.

00:21:17.460 --> 00:21:19.590
Isn't such the way of the gods?

00:21:20.580 --> 00:21:24.370
People... Those on this side
dote on them without recompense.

00:21:25.120 --> 00:21:28.390
We merely... offer them our love.

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:34.860
A scant two years

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:38.400
have changed you from being
that monster of a man...

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:44.280
Or have you found something
that you hold dearer than life itself?

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:47.410
How dare a depraved murderer...

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.540
...speak of gods!

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:41.060
A Promise

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:29.970
Rio, aren't you being
too lenient on Shii?

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:31.050
You think so as well?

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:32.840
You need to set firm boundaries.

00:23:32.840 --> 00:23:34.100
I shall change my stance on the matter.

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:34.920
Good, good.

00:23:34.920 --> 00:23:37.590
Kaname, don't eat sweets in the study.
Don't drop crumbs.

00:23:37.590 --> 00:23:39.050
Wake up ten minutes
earlier in the morning.

00:23:39.050 --> 00:23:40.560
You're setting boundaries for me?!
